  "principles": [
    "Hyperpop chord stabs — minor key, simple i-VI loop, sharp staccato attacks with short release",
    "Aggressive trap/breakcore drums at 140-155 BPM: 16th hats with 32nd-note rolls, chopped breakcore snares, hard 808 kicks",
    "Distorted maximum texture — 808 locked to the kick with octave glides, bright supersaw stabs and pads pumping against the kick, filter-swept builds with pitch risers",
    "Energy contrast — drumless intro, halftime verse A, four-on-the-floor build with a snare roll, wall-of-sound drop"
  ],
