      "song": "Spoiled Little Brat"
    }
  ],
  "research_sources": [
    "Ported from claude_code/plans/scenecore-composition.md (Ace-Step DAW reference)",
    "https://blog.soundtrap.com/?p=742 (hyperpop: distinct intro loop, build until drums + 808 enter, 808 glides)",
    "https://www.musehub.com/course/g3-course-hyperpop-production-explained (break-loop layering, clipping/saturation on drums, tempo changes)",
    "https://www.musehub.com/course/g3-course-hyperpop-production-explained (tempo changes as an arrangement device)"
  ],
