    "notes": "Synths on Serum 2 / Vital (instruments/serum-2.json, vital.json: MIDI Learn cutoff to CC74, volume to CC7; Mono+Legato portamento on the 808 for glides). Drums on UJAM Beatmaker (HUSTLE for trap) or any drum map via --vst."
  },
  "notes": "Seeded from the Ace-Step scenecore plan, expanded with form/fills/motif/section bindings. trap-hat-rolls uses a 32-step hat grid for 32nd-note rolls."
